## Conclusion

# No overall colour cast: the DLSS/TAAU per-channel mean ratios stay within 1.5% on run 1
# and 0.4% on run 3, with no systematic channel skew; mean luma differs by 0.02% (run 1)
# and 0.5% (run 3). The 32x32 tile structure correlates at 0.957/1.000, so the remaining
# differences are detail/sharpening, not a global shift. The earlier two-screenshot
# attempt (22:53) was not usable as F2 evidence: the game PNG is a 2560x1440 canvas with
# only the top-left 1133x933 opaque, and the two shots were 6 s apart across a mode
# switch (exposure adapting), which produced a ~6% luma gap.
